[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16450.551, "timestamp": "04:34:10", "text": "第二。回来。嗯，是的，我们当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16453.269, "timestamp": "04:34:13", "text": "看着那场巡回演出，真是太棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16456.07, "timestamp": "04:34:16", "text": "我不认识Twitch上的内容创作者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16458.47, "timestamp": "04:34:18", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。他们就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16460.109, "timestamp": "04:34:20", "text": "不同的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16463.75, "timestamp": "04:34:23", "text": "氛围。你是怎么做到的？当你这样做的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16465.75, "timestamp": "04:34:25", "text": "在YouTube上刷了一整天，你会意识到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16468.519, "timestamp": "04:34:28", "text": "关于表演"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16469.869, "timestamp": "04:34:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16479.51, "timestamp": "04:34:39", "text": "说实话，这感觉太不对劲了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16482.39, "timestamp": "04:34:42", "text": "我自称YouTuber已经五年了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16485.99, "timestamp": "04:34:45", "text": "年。这些东西我一个都不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16488.15, "timestamp": "04:34:48", "text": "我不了解赞助方面的情况。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16491.51, "timestamp": "04:34:51", "text": "知道他……他说了什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16493.75, "timestamp": "04:34:53", "text": "再次？天哪，我忘了那些术语了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16496.349, "timestamp": "04:34:56", "text": "你用过。太多了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16497.949, "timestamp": "04:34:57", "text": "事物。"}]